        "id": 11059
      },
      "writtenOn": "2023-12-21T22:53:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "Could we always use `skvx::Vec\u003cN,float\u003e` instead of just for `float4`? This seems a lot nicer and skvx should support any N here (although perhaps only using scalars for N\u003c4).\n\nI think the only reason I used `SkFloatToHalf` originally was that I didn\u0027t realize `skvx` exposed conversion to half.",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 363,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 363,
        "endChar": 60
      },
      "revId": "9876b6c4aa7d5d3d76618685d6867d1b8ddc1cb3",
