        "filename": "src/gpu/graphite/UniformManager.h",
        "patchSetId": 5
      },
      "lineNbr": 363,
      "author": {
        "id": 8341
      },
      "writtenOn": "2024-01-03T16:42:39Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "`skvx` doesn\u0027t support N\u003d3 so we need the loop and the only true specialization for `to_half` is when N\u003d4. N\u003d2 might be able to use some SIMD instructions but N\u003d1 would work out to `SkFloatToHalf` anyways and I think this will have less overall code size vs. generating a an N\u003d2 `to_half` variant.  WDYT?",
      "parentUuid": "ac024079_cb3c0720",
      "range": {
        "startLine": 363,
        "startChar": 0,
        "endLine": 363,
        "endChar": 60
      },
